[["heading","SECTION 22 / 34   •   PRACTICAL PROJECT"],["heading","Pharmacy inventory: setup and queries"],["sinhala","","Medi Track වJගේ pharmacy system එකක් සඳහා synthetic products data භාවිත කරලා stock search,",503],["sinhala","","category summary සහ safe inventory update practice කරමු. Jමේක original project code එකක් Jනාව",509],["sinhala","","අලුත් educational example එකක්.",171],["text","React product list\nExpress API\nproducts collection"],["text","Checkout request\nconditional stock update\nsuccess or conflict"],["heading","Step 1 / Setup a fresh practice database (mongosh)"],["code","use pharmacy_practice_22\ndb.products.createIndex({sku:1},{unique:true});\ndb.products.insertMany([\n {sku:\"P1\",name:\"Vitamin C\",category:\"medicine\",stock:20,price:100},\n {sku:\"P2\",name:\"Pain relief\",category:\"medicine\",stock:5,price:200},\n {sku:\"P3\",name:\"Soap\",category:\"care\",stock:12,price:50}\n]);"],["heading","Step 2 / Find low stock and total stock by category"],["code","db.products.find({stock:{$lt:10}},{_id:0,sku:1,stock:1});\ndb.products.aggregate([\n {$group:{_id:\"$category\",total:{$sum:\"$stock\"}}},\n {$sort:{_id:1}}\n]);"],["heading","Query\nExpected results"],["text","Low stock\nP2, stock 5"],["text","Category totals\ncare: 12; medicine: 25"],["text","Use a fresh test database; rerunning the seed with the same SKUs will raise a duplicate-key error."]]